# RuleNest — Supabase Auth
#
# Copy this file to ".env.local" (or set in your hosting dashboard) to enable
# real authentication. Without these, the app shows a friendly
# "Auth not configured" state instead of crashing.
#
#  1. Create a project at https://supabase.com
#  2. Enable Google provider + Email/Password in Authentication → Providers
#  3. Add your site URL to Auth → URL Configuration (Redirect URLs too)
#  4. Set the two vars below:
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR-ANON-KEY